WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.870
Did you know Apple’s former chief&nbsp;
designer Jony Ive decided to add a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:08.070
handle to the iMac not for carrying&nbsp;
but to build a bond with the user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:12.030
to make it seem more approachable at a&nbsp;
time when computers were new and scary.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.030
The iMac was also translucent for this reason.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.830
So, our clear goal was how we can make the&nbsp;
product accessible and not intimidating.

